<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="JOL" style="id">Joel</book>
  <para style="h">Joel</para>
  <para style="toc1">Joel</para>
  <para style="toc2">Joel</para>
  <para style="mt">Joel</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pethuel ih fapa Joel hnenah Bawipa ih simmi thu cu:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Patar pawl, ngaihnik uh; Judah ram sungih ummi pawl theihnik uh; Hi bangtuk hi nanmah nun sungah a cang dah maw? Nan pale sanah teh a cang dah keel maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hi thu cu nan faale hnenah sim uh, Cun annih in an faate hnenah simsin ve hai seh. Sankhat hnu sankhat ah simsin aw vivo hai seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Thing ngeet kharbok ih hlah mi kha, A burbur ih ummi kharbok in an ei. A burbur ih ummi kharbok ih hlah mi kha, A pet vivo mi kharbok in an ei. A pet vivo mi kharbok ih hlah mi kha, Siatsuahtu kharbok in an ei ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nannih zuri pawl, tho uhla ṭap uh, Sabitti intu pawl, sabit thawthaw hrangah ṭap uh; Ziangahtile an siat ṭheh zo a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kharbok bur in kan ram an siim; An cak ngaingai ih siar cawk lo an si. An ha cu kiosa ha vek a si ih, An tin tla cu kiosapi ih tin vek a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka sabit hri an siatsuah ṭheh, Ka theipi kung cu an ngeetkiak ṭheh ih hnah nei lo ah an tuah; A rah an ei ṭheh, a hawng an hawk ṭheh; A hnge pawl cu raang ko in an hiikfai ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Nannih minung pawl, A pasal dingmi tlangval pa ih thihsanmi fala nu a ṭah bangin, Buri hnipuan hruk ih a ṭah bangtuk in ṭap uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Thawinak ih pek dingah sabit le sangphut cu Bawipa ih inn ah a um nawn lo. Bawipa riantu nannih puithiam pawl ṭap uh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Loram cu a siat ṭheh, leilung cu riahsia in a ṭap. Thlairawl an siat ṭheh, Sabit an ro ṭheh ih Olif in hriak a suah nawn lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Lothlo pawl, nan riahsia uh, Sabit tuamhlawmtu pawl, riahsia in ṭap uh. Sangvut le barli sangvut an um lo, Rawl lak ding zianghman a um lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Sabit hri an vuai ih Theipi kung an caar. Taleti kung, ung kung, epal kung le thingkung dangdang tla an ro ṭheh. Minung hrangah lungawinak le Thinnomnak a cem a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Maw puithiam pawl, biakṭheng ih hnaṭuantu pawl, Buri hnipuan hruk in ṭap uh. Biakinn ah feh uhla zanvar ṭap uh. Nan Pathian pek dingah rawl le Sabitti a cem ṭheh zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Rawl ulh ni than uh, Khawmnak thianghlim tuah ni ti uh! Upa pawl ko khawm hai uhla Ramsung minung pawl sawm ṭheh uh. Bawipa inn sungah ra tlaang uhla Bawipa Pathian hnenah cun ṭap uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Cuih ni cu hreh a va um so! Cuih Bawipa ni cu a nai thlang; Cungnungbik hnen ihsin a nasa zet mi siatsuahnak thawn a ra.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Kan mithmuh rori ah rawl an hlo ṭheh; Kan Pathian inn ihsin lungawinak le thinnomnak a cem ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Leilung a caar ih thlaici an thi ṭheh. Rawl retnak an siatral ṭheh, Thlairawl ret ding a um nawn lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ṭilva pawl an ai an hruum, Cawcang pawl an van a saang. Ziangahtile ei ding hrampi a um lo; Tuu run pawl khal in an tuar a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Maw Bawipa nangmah ka lo ko; Ziangahtile meisa in phuul ih hrampi a kang fai ih, Mei alh in hramlak ih thing tiangin a kang fai a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Asi, hramlak ih ramsa hman in nangmah an lo hai nasa; Ziangahtile tiva tete an caar ih, Hrampi hmuahhmuah meisa in a kang ṭheh a si.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Zion ah tawtawrawt phaw uhla, Pathian tlang thianghlim ah ralrinnak dar tum uh. Hi ramih a ummi hmuahhmuah khur hai seh; Ziangahtile Bawipa ih ni a nai zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Thimnak le khawdurnak ni, Mero le suum ih a khah ni a si. Tlang parah thimnak bangin kharbok an ra; Mi cakzet le mi nasazet ralkap bangin. Hi bangtuk cu khuahlan san ihsin a um dah keel lo; Hmailam san, san-i-khuk khalah a um dah lo dingmi a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hmaituang meisa in ziang hmuahhmuah a kang; Dungṭang meisa hlio a alh ringring. An hmailam ih ram cu Eden hmuan bangtuk a si; An dunglam cu ramṭhing ah a cang, An fehnak lamzin ah zianghman a nung thei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />To rang bangin a rualrual in an ra; Raldonak rang bangin hmaiah an tlan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Rangleeng ke awn bangin an awn durdo, Tlang par ahcun an pet zohzo. An thawmvang cu fangkuang meisa kaang awn bangtuk a si. Raldo ding ralkap bangin siar cawk lo an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />An hmaiah mi hmuahhmuah an thin a phang; An mithmai a raam ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ralṭha bik bangin hmaiah an nor, Ralkap bangin phar ah an kai. Anmah ih zawn cio in an feh, An fehnak ding lamzin in zohman an peeng lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Pakhat le pakhat an pah-aw lo. Hmailam ah cawl bang loin dingtein an feh ih, Zohman in an kham thei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Khawpi an thleng, phar ah an van; Inn parah an kai ih Fifir bangin tukvirh in an lut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />An hmaiah leilungpi hi a khur, Van khal khi a hnin; Ni le thlapi an thim, Arsi pawl an tleu nawn lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Bawipa ih thupeknak aw cu a ralkap hmaiah khawri bangin a ri durdo; A ralkap cu an nasa ngaingai; A tirhfialmi cu siarcawk lo an si. Bawipa ih ni cu a nasa ih tuksumza a si; Zoso a tuar thei ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Bawipa in, “Atu rori ah Nan thinlung zatein rawl ul in, Mitthli tla le riahsia in, Ka hnenah ra kir uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Nan hnipuan thlek loin nan thinlung khuai sawn uh; Cule ka hnenah ra kir uh,” tiah a ti. Bawipa nan Pathian hnen ahcun ra kir uh; Ziangahtile amah cu zaangfahnak le lainatnak neitu a si; A thin a fual ih a ṭunghmunmi duhdawtnak in a khat; Hrem a tummi khal a suup sal ṭheu a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Bawipa nan Pathian in a thinlung leet sal in, Lo rawl tampi a lo thlawsuah tla a si thei sokhaw. Cutin sangphut le sabit thawinak, a hnenah nan pe ding a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Zion Tlangah tawtawrawt tum uh, Rawl ul ding thu than uhla misenpi pumkhawmnak tuah uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Mipi kokhawm uhla khawmpi sunglawi tuah uh. Upa pawl ko uhla, nauhak pawl kha kokhawm uh. Asi, an ṭaang ih an cawimi naute khal kokhawm uh. Nupi ṭhitu tlangval a inn ihsin ra suak seh; Cun mothar khal a innkhaan sung ihsin ra suak seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Bawipa ih hnaṭuantu puithiam pawl cu Biakinn luhnak sangka le biakṭheng karlak ah ding tahrat in: “Maw Bawipa , na minung pawl hi zuah hram aw; Ram dangmi pawl in hmuhsuam le nautat in, ‘Khui-ah so nan Pathian cu a um?’ in ti hlah hai seh” tiah thlacam in ṭap hai seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Cule Bawipa in a ram zawn a ruahnak a langter; A minung pawl a lainat a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />An ṭahnak aw a thei ih an hnenah, “Ngai uh, rawl le sabit le olif siti ka lo pe hai ding ih, Nan ei nan in ding ih nan tlai zet ding. Miphun tampi hmai ah mualpho in Ka lo umter nawn lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Saklam ralkap nan ṭihmi pawl cu Nan hnen ihsin hlatpi ah ka re ding; Ramcaar le ramṭhing ah ka dawi hlo hai ding; An hmaituang pawl cu nisuahnak tipi thi sungah, Dungṭang ih fehtu pawl cu nitlak lam tifinriat sungah, Ka dawihlo ding. An ruak thu le nam cu khua hlapi a thleng ding; Puarthau in thil a tuah ruangah!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Maw leilung, zianghman ṭih hlah, na thla khal ṭem hlah; Lungawi soparte in um aw. Bawipa in mangbangza thil a tuah zo a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hramlak ih ṭilva pawl, nan thin phang hlah uh; Nan tlannak hrampi cu a hring ringring ding; Thing an rah ding ih theipi le Sabit khal an rah ngaingai ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />“Maw Zion mi pawl, thinnuam in um uh; Bawipa nan Pathian hnenah nan lung awi uh. Amah in nan ṭul zat in ṭhal ruah a surter; Thlatang ruah le ṭoruah thawn, A hlan bangin a surter a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Nan rawl ciilnak hmun cu rawl in a khat ding ih, Nan ralca beel pawl cu sabit le olif hriak in a liam ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Nan hnen ih ka run thlah mi Thing ngeet kharbok, a bur a bur ih ummi kharbok, A pet vivo mi kharbok pawl ih a eimi pawl cu ka lo ruul sal hai ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />“Nan duhzat in nan ei ding ih nan tlai zet ding; Cutin Bawipa nan Pathian hmin cu nan thangṭhat ding. Nan hrangah mangbangza a tuah zo. Ka minung pawl cu mualpho in an um nawn lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Israel mi lakih ka um kha nan thei ding; Bawipa Keimah lawng hi nan Pathian ka si. Pathian dang a um lo; Ka minung pawl cu mualpho in an um nawn lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />“Leh hnuah cun mi hmuahhmuah parah ka thlarau ka burh ding; Nan fapa le nan fanu pawl in, profet bangin ka thu an phuang ding. Nan patar pawl in mang an man ding; Nan mino pawl in langnak an hmu ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Cutik ni ahcun salnu le salpa pawl par tiangin ka thlarau ka burh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />“Van ah siseh lei ah siseh, Thilmak zetzet ka langter ding. Thisen le meisa le meikhu tom an lang ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ni a thim ding ih, Thlapi cu thi bangin a sen ding, A nasazet le hreh a um zetmi Bawipa ih ni a thlen hlan deuh caan ahcun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Cutikah Bawipa ih hmin a kotu hmuahhmuah cu runnak an ngah ding. Ziangahtile Bawipa ih a sim zo vekin Zion Tlang ah a luatmi an um ding; Jerusalem ah a taangsun an um ding; Bawipa ih kawhmi pawl cu!” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Judah le Jerusalem mivannei ih ka tuah ni le tikcu ahcun,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />miphun hmuahhmuah cu hmunkhat ah ka ko khawm ding ih, Bawipa ih Thuṭhennak Horkuam ah ka vun hruai hai ding. Ka miphun a si mi Israel ai-awh in an thu ka ṭhen ding. Ziangahtile ka minung pawl an ram sung ciar ah an ṭhekdarh hai ih ka ram cu an ṭhen aw ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka minung pawl cu camcawhfung zuuk in an zem aw. Cuih tlunah mipa nauhak le nunau nauhak salah an zuar ih an ngahmi paisa in hlawhhlang an leeng ih zu in dingah zu an lei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka hrangah ziangso nan si nannih Ṭaiar le Sidon le Filistin ram pawl? Ka parah phuba lak nan tum maw si? Ka parah ziangtal phuba lak theimi nan nei maw? Nan neih a si ahcun cakzet le zamrang zetin nan thil tuahmi cu nan lu parah ka kirter ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ziangahtile ka sui le ka ngun le ka hlawnthil sunglawi pawl cu nan biakinn ah nan thiar ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Judah le Jerusalem mi pawl cu an ram ihsin lamhlapi ah nan fehpi ih Grik mi pawl hnenah nan zuar.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Sikhalsehla nan zuarnak hmun ahcun ka forh hai ding ih cuih hmun cu an tlansan ding. Nan thil tuahmi cu nan lu parah ka kirter ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Nan fanu le nan fapa pawl Judah mi hnenah ka zuar ding ih annih in lamhlapi ih a ummi Seba mi hnenah an zorh ding. Bawipa in a sim zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Hi thu hi miphun hmuahhmuah hnenah than uh; Raldo dingah timtuah uhla nan ralkap tho hai seh. Raldo ding hmuahhmuah cu hmunkhat ah tong aw in feh hai seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Nan lei lehnak tuhmui pawl cu ralnam ah ser uh; Nan thingfa cehnak cehrep cu feipi ah tuah uh. Mi derdai bik khal in do ve hai seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Zamrang in ra suak uh, Kiangkap miphun hmuahhmuah, Cutawkah tongkhawm aw uh,” a ti. Maw Bawipa , na ralkap pawl, raldo dingah run kuat aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Miphun hmuahhmuah in raldo dingah pok hai seh; Bawipa ih Thuṭhennak Horkuam ah feh hai seh. Ziangahtile miphun hmuahhmuah thuṭhen dingah, Cutawkah ka to ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Rawl ah a cu, namkawi suah uh; Ra uh, sabit ra sawr uh. Sabit sawrnak khur a khat, ralca beel an liam. An sualnak a nasa ngaingai a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mi thawng tampi an um, Thuṭhennak Horkuam sungah. Thuṭhennak Horkuam ah Bawipa ih ni a nai zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ni le thlapi cu an thim. Arsi an tleu nawn lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Bawipa cu Zion ihsin a hruum ding; Jerusalem ihsin a aw a suah ding. Cutikah lei le van an hnin ṭheh ding; Asinain a minung hrangah Bawipa cu an beunak a si; Israel hrangah amah cu an himnak ṭanhmun a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Cutiin keimah cu Bawipa nan Pathian ka si kha nan thei ding; Ka tlang thianghlim Zion ih a ummi ka si! Jerusalem cu khua thianghlim a si ding; Ram dangmi zohman in, Jerusalem khua sung an pal thei lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Cuih ni ahcun tlangsaang ihsin Sabitti a puut ding; Tlang fatete ihsin cawhnawi a luang ding. Judah ram tiva hmuahhmuah ah tidai an luang ding; Bawipa ih inn ihsin cirhti a puut ding ih, Sittim phairawn in tidai a ngah ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“Asinain Izipt cu nelrawn ro ah a cang ding ih, Edom ram cu thlaler ramṭhing ah a cang ding. Ziangahtile Judah ramah thil poimawh an tuah ih, Mawh neilo thisen an suahter ruangah a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Sikhalsehla Judah ramah kumkhua in minung an tlangleng ding; Jerusalem ah cat loin minung an um ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />An thisen man cu keimah in phuba ka la ding; Bawipa keimah cu Zion ah ka um ding,” a ti.
  </para>
</usx>
